msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"Did you hear why Takahashi-kun hasn't been coming to school\r\n"
"lately? They say the Devil Cat got him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"You mean the one that creeps up from behind and haunts you till you're dead?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Uh-huh. They say that if it ends up following you, a horrible tragedy is "
"bound to happen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"Well, Takahashi-kun is in the hospital... Heard he got caught up in a fight "
"or something. You think it's the Devil Cat's fault?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "It has to be! I'm telling you, that cat is nothing but bad luck!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Stop it, Haruko. If the Devil Cat hears you, it'll come for you next!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"That's really too bad, 'cause I love felines. By the way,\r\n"
"don't a lot of cats gather in front of Aqua Sky behind the\r\n"
"station?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"Oh yeah, the owner's always putting catnip out so lots end up over there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"Maybe the Devil Cat's there, too, rubbing tails with the others. Ahahaha."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "(A Devil Cat that brings bad luck? That's absurd.)"
msgstr ""

